# One Tower from street level — the point family at Tile 592 592, 64 storeys on a 2-storey podium.
# Tilt 4 is the shallowest the shell allows, which puts the eye about 27 m up and 380 m south of
# the site, so the podium and the shaft above it are seen as a passer-by sees them. The band
# reaches 1,600 m so every Tower in frame draws as a body.
2 pause
2 ui family-bodies on 1600
2 roads on
2 focus 592 592 380
2 tilt 4
2 shoot artifacts/tall-families/drive/tower-street.png
2 draw artifacts/tall-families/drive/tower-street.tsv
2 quit
